        "summaryEn": "The environmental sector in Tanzania encompasses municipal and hazardous waste recycling, wastewater and industrial effluent treatment plants, clean energy deployment, mandatory ESIA studies for infrastructure and extractive industries, and automated air/water quality monitoring.",
